# The pictures of chamfer.md: a rectangle extruded, two top edges
# picked and chamfered, the distance changed, then a second distance
# given and swapped; last, the chamfercorner example. Coordinates are
# those of the 600x600 headless window.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
# The edges are picked in the view from above.
cursor on
move 202.5 282.5
down L 202.5 282.5
up L 202.5 282.5
move 317.5 327.5
down L 317.5 327.5
up L 317.5 327.5
shot chamfer-1-edges gw
menu Features|Chamfer Edges
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
cursor off
shot chamfer-2-chamfered
cursor on
twmove 186 125
mark 28 122 208 22 tw
shot chamfer-3-distance-link tw
twdown L 186 125
twup L 186 125
edit 10
cursor off
shot chamfer-4-distance-10
# Two distances: the second row, then [swap].
cursor on
twmove 263 145
mark 28 142 307 22 tw
shot chamfer-5-second-link tw
twdown L 263 145
twup L 263 145
edit 4
cursor off
shot chamfer-6-two-distances
twmove 310 145
twdown L 310 145
twup L 310 145
shot chamfer-7-swapped
# The chamfercorner example: every edge at 2 and 4 mm.
# A new file first: an example draws from a fresh sketch.
answer no
menu File|New
file $repo/examples/scripts/chamfercorner/chamfercorner.go
menu Script|Run File...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
shot chamfer-8-corners gw
